(text "POWER. J0 battery in -> 10A ATO -> SMDJ58CA -> LM74800 + 2x BSC070N10NS5 back-to-back (VBAT_P).\nOV 30.3V / UV 5.5V (191k/45.3k/10k, 1.231V thresholds). LM5176 buck-boost -> +12V (FB 140k/10k, RT 27k ~290kHz).\nTPS56637 -> +5V (FB 75k/10k = 5.1V). TPS56637 -> +3V3 from +12V (FB 45.3k/10k, 2.2uH, 3x22u), >=3A." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "38b0e7e8-4af1-42f4-a3c3-8ccb72725329"))
)
